## 🎤 Section 2: Developer Discovery & Feedback Protocol
*Practical user research queries used on regular customer discovery calls to spot implementation friction for engineering teams.*

1. **The Sandbox Experience:** *"When you first initiated our self-serve local sandbox environment, what was the exact point of friction? Did the logs clearly outline your policy constraints?"*
2. **Latency & Verification Friction:** *"Because Saifuro compares tracking requests synchronously with a human mandate, did your agent encounter execution lag while waiting for the cryptographically signed verdict?"*
3. **Escrow Fallbacks:** *"Your agent is running on our Solana/Base escrow settlements. How comfortable are you with the programmatic fallback states if a trade loop breaks mid-transaction?"*
4. **The "Why" Matrix:** *"When an engineer's pull request fails a validation check, what additional logging parameters would make troubleshooting easier for your support staff?"*

